{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40723","headline":"送郄先辈归觐华阴 · 李洞","name":"送郄先辈归觐华阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂枝博得凤栖枝，欢觐家僮舞翠微。\n僧向瀑泉声里贺，鸟穿仙掌指间飞。\n休停砚笔吟荒庙，永别灯笼赴锁闱。\n骚雅近来颓丧甚，送君傍觉有光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}